{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S08、S11、S12只有20—25秒，Y仍安排了较多叙事句和感受提示，连续扫读的压力明显高于X，X的双栏布局在这几段更容易快速获取大意。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过【】突出每段真正的叙事落点，感受又以小字和音乐时点交替出现，观众不必同时处理所有信息，更容易边听边抓住情绪变化。它对怀念、委屈、孤独、依恋和自我坚持之间的细微转换交代得更具体，反复出现的“当作自己人”“不必防备”“自己扛”等线索也让前后形成了连续的心理发展，而不只是情绪词的集合。X的双栏确实更方便快速浏览，但右侧感受词经常同时堆叠，情绪与叙事的对应关系、音乐过程中的细腻变化都不如Y清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "95d62eef-c5c4-4701-891c-bc9a1fd57ee6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053804543584Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:39:13.158640+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "261d53d3f72c1f28d62e5d6a6ebf235c85c52a0afc752740b6ff56c98e571d55", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3